Rewards
    Give 57500000 experience
    Give 100000 coins
    Give 50 np
    Give 1 of 900106000

On available
    Say "There's a last instruction from the authority of the [Order of the Sorcery]. Let's go to Sais of [Order of the Sorcery] at once."

On offer
    Show quest "You are here. This is our last chance to turn the war around. If we succeed, our force will rise again.\n\nI'll give you the last order. You have to seal [Devil 5] President Marbas, who has great fame even in Hell. He's a high-ranked devil who governs thirty-six legions. He's very dangerous and needs to be watched for, because he can cause and spread diseases. Go to [Eslant] with the [Devil 5 Summoning Scroll] and destroy him after summoning him from the [Devil 5 Summoning Stone]. We'll have a chance to counterattack if he's removed.\n\nYou have to receive [Devil 5 Summoning Scroll] from [Order of the sorcery] Seis, of Ronark Land. Then, summon [Devil 5] Marbas from [Devil 5 Summoning Stone] at El Morad Castle area and kill him. \n※ [Devil 5 Summoning Scroll] is free the first time, but from the next time on you'll have to pay a million Noahs."

On in_progress
    Say "The war is still unfavorable for us. Please lend is a little more power."

On claimable
    Show quest "Have you succeeded? It is true!! You have just given us a big hope.\n\nLet's drive this momentum. You need to eliminate [16Devil] Zepar, the duke of the west wind. They say he brings the victory wind. With him is [40Devil] Raum. Eliminate both of them and let's take their wind of victory."
